chibi-scheme (0.12-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  [ Shriram Ravindranathan ]
  * New upstream version 0.12
  * Drop d/libchibi-scheme-ffi.lintian-overrides:
    - It contained two overrides, one was an alien tag and the other was
      unused.
  * debian/control:
    - Fix binNMU-unsafe dependency (chibi-scheme-images -> chibi-scheme).
    - Bump Standards-Version to 4.7.4
    - Remove `Priority: optional`: this is the default now.
    - Remove `Rules-Requires-Root: no`: this is the default now.
  * debian/watch: Upgrade to version 5
  * debian/libchibi-scheme0.symbols:
    - Regenerate file to add 11 new symbols.
    - Mark arch-dependent symbols as (optional) to fix 32bit builds.
  * debian/patches/*:
    - Add 0016-fix-reproducible-builds.patch to remove volatile memory
      addresses and timestamps from documentation for reproducible builds.
    - Refresh patches.
  * debian/copyright:
    - Add missing copyright blocks and attributions, and update copyright
      years.

  [ Barak A. Pearlmutter ]
  * Add chibi-scheme dependency to chibi-scheme-images
  * Standardize maintenance team in d/control and add Shriram Ravindranathan

 -- Barak A. Pearlmutter <bap@debian.org>  Sun, 10 May 2026 16:03:49 +0100

